        "her baby was born,",
        "and on Feb 14th she",
        "died in my arms;",
        "On my mother had",
        "died in the same",
        "house, on the same",
        "day, but a few",
        "hours previously, On",
        "Feb 16th they were",
        "buried together in",
        "Greenwood.",
        "On Feb 17th I",
        "christenned the baby",
        "Alice Lee Roosevelt.",
        "",
        "For joy or for sorrow",
        "my life has now been",
        "lived out"
